                    "text": "Did you know that 7 out of 10 retirees can't keep their homes clean even when they have all day? They sit down \"just for a minute\" and three hours disappear. A neuroscientist says it's because their brains are protecting them from feeling overwhelmed. There's finally a simple fix that actually works. \n\n👉🏼 Read about breakthrough here",
